
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Code-list bindings
#
#  Which code list each coded property takes its values from. The ranges above
#  say only skos:Concept; these annotations name the scheme. An extension may
#  bind a property to its own scheme instead, for example a firm's risk scale
#  in place of the illustrative one.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

pwm:actionVerb pwm:valuesFrom pwm:ActionVerbScheme .
pwm:amlRiskLevel pwm:valuesFrom pwm:AMLRiskLevelScheme .
pwm:appliesToActivity pwm:valuesFrom pwm:CrossBorderActivityScheme .
